==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[black]]-[[headed]] [[gull]]}}

# A small [[gull]], ''[[Chroicocephala ridibundus]]'', which breeds in much of [[Europe]] and [[Asia]], and also in coastal eastern [[Canada]].

